		ad, intensive, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to guide</i>, <i>govern</i>, <i>manage.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adguberno iter pedibus,</span>”
