					3, 5, 16</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">adgubernante fortunā,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					2, 8, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
